    contract: Islands of Light / Unbound
    text: "SABLE / community grid engineer: Complete your alliance\u2019s final operation against the distributed fallback system. The sender asks you to keep the names attached to the evidence; anonymous totals have concealed people before."
  - id: shelter-ending-open/1
    title: Islands of Light / Unbound / Custody note
    company:
    contract: Islands of Light / Unbound
    text: 'Archive custody, Islands of Light / Unbound: Independent districts keep their own power and identity ledgers. The Directorate loses its monopoly on continuity. The release reaches every district at once. It breaks the old consensus and leaves difficult repairs for the survivors. A second copy carries a hand-written objection to the official disposition.'
