    text: 'Personal note filed under shelter-ending-open: Independent districts keep their own power and identity ledgers. The Directorate loses its monopoly on continuity. The release reaches every district at once. It breaks the old consensus and leaves difficult repairs for the survivors. Someone has crossed out the word inevitable. No replacement was supplied.'
